### 🚨 Limitations
- **Dynamic Scripts**: This approach may miss dynamically loaded scripts or scripts embedded via `eval()`/`new Function()`.
- **False Positives**: The tracking domain list is simplified; real-world use requires a curated list (e.g., from [Privacy Badger](https://github.com/efforg/privacybadger)).
